config PERF_COUNT_ONLY
	bool "Allocate only event (count) perf counters"
	default n
	depends on !SYSTEMCMDS_PERF
	help
	  perf_alloc() returns nullptr for elapsed and interval counters, which
	  are only read by the perf command. Saves heap on boards with little RAM
	  that do not build the perf command. Event counters are kept because
	  drivers read them for error reporting.
